      en: ["The forest is a core component of the Laiala public park system.", "Native oaks and ashes form the majority of the canopy.", "It serves as a critical habitat for the local red squirrel population.", "The area was historically used for grazing before reforestation.", "Environmental monitoring stations are located within the woods.", "It provides significant carbon sequestration for the Serravalle district."],
